  "title": "Magellan arrives in the Philippines",
  "summary": "Magellan's fleet reached the islands later called the Philippines in March 1521, first meeting inhabitants on Homonhon on 17 March. It moved on to Limasawa for an Easter Mass on 31 March and to Cebu on 7 April. Magellan was killed fighting on Mactan on 27 April.",
